{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>בארבעים</b> — twice in the Masorah: בארבעים שנה, בארבעים אלף בישראל — to teach: if there is one Torah scholar among forty thousand, they need neither spear nor shield, for the Torah scholar protects them from their enemies, as the subject there is a Torah scholar, as stated: לבי לחוקקי ישראל, and here too, written immediately after it is the matter of Torah, as stated: הואיל משה באר את התורה."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:08:26.045991066Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}